#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="tmdb_movie_10398" tvg-name="Double Jeopardy" tvg-logo="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPd9QvEeMQpgHO6iLB1LqALTZl.jpg" tvg-backdrop="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fk4NXhazfRKtQaVEV9IPeM7OIVH.jpg" tvg-type="movie" tvg-genre="Dark Mystery Files" tvg-description="Libby Parsons, wrongly convicted of her husband Nick's murder, thinks he is still alive. She survives the long years in prison with two burning desires sustaining her -- finding her son and solving the mystery that destroyed her once-happy life. Standing between her and her quest, however, is her parole officer, Travis Lehman. Libby poses a challenge to the cynical officer, one that forces him to face up to his own failings while pitting him against his superior and law enforcement colleagues, as she plunges into a desperate fight for justice, survival, and revenge." tvg-year="1999" tvg-cast="Ashley Judd, Tommy Lee Jones, Bruce Greenwood, Annabeth Gish, Benjamin Weir" tvg-director="Bruce Beresford" group-title="Dark Mystery Files",Double Jeopardy
